"``gnubg/formatgs.c:399–409`` — päätöskohtainen virheprosentti (”Error "
"rate per decision”)."

#: ../../source/stats_parity.rst:299
msgid "``gnubg/formatgs.c:415–424`` — Snowie Error Rate."
msgstr "``gnubg/formatgs.c:415–424`` — Snowie Error Rate."

